{
  "id": "c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Taking entrepreneurial risks",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good afternoon. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, have you ever considered starting your own business?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what qualities do you think are important for success in business?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how do you feel about taking financial risks?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, who do you admire as a successful entrepreneur?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e10-a1",
            "c1-e10-a2",
            "c1-e10-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people involved in business. Choose two of the pictures and say what risks the people have taken, and how they might be feeling about the future.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11400
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these people do you think has the biggest challenge?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e10-b1",
            "c1-e10-b2",
            "c1-e10-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people who depend on business success. Choose two of the pictures and say what has helped these people to succeed, and what might go wrong.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, would you rather work for a big company or run your own?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some things that can help a new business to succeed, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10700
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these factors contribute to the success of a start-up?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7200
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which is the most important in the first year?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about entrepreneurship and risk.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "To what extent do you think entrepreneurs are born rather than made?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, should governments do more to support people who want to start businesses?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, is failure in business something to be ashamed of or something to learn from?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "How might the culture of entrepreneurship change the way young people think about careers?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6000
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think big companies have too much power over small businesses?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, are the risks of working for yourself greater than the rewards?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e10-taking-entrepreneurial-risks/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
